  description: A knight of the Kingdom of Grandshelt, Rain was an affable airship
    captain whose easygoing nature masked his skill for learning complicated skills
    very quickly. He prefers to charge into battle heedless of the danger around
    him, especially when in the presence of a fair maiden.
  summonDesc: Protecting the helpless is not only my job, but the right thing to
    do.
  fusionDesc: I feel stronger somehow... Have I done this before?
